{"suttaId":"thag6.4","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1777,1795],"vripara":"393"},"segments":{"thag6.4:0.4":"Kullattheragāthā","thag6.4:1.1":"“Kullo sivathikaṃ gantvā, addasa itthimujjhitaṃ;","thag6.4:1.3":"Apaviddhaṃ susānasmiṃ, khajjantiṃ kimihī phuṭaṃ.","thag6.4:2.1":"“Āturaṃ asuciṃ pūtiṃ, passa kulla samussayaṃ;","thag6.4:2.3":"Uggharantaṃ paggharantaṃ, bālānaṃ abhinanditaṃ.","thag6.4:3.1":"“Dhammādāsaṃ gahetvāna, ñāṇadassanapattiyā;","thag6.4:3.3":"Paccavekkhiṃ imaṃ kāyaṃ, tucchaṃ santarabāhiraṃ.","thag6.4:4.1":"“Yathā idaṃ tathā etaṃ, yathā etaṃ tathā idaṃ;","thag6.4:4.3":"Yathā adho tathā uddhaṃ, yathā uddhaṃ tathā adho.","thag6.4:5.1":"“Yathā divā tathā rattiṃ, yathā rattiṃ tathā divā;","thag6.4:5.3":"Yathā pure tathā pacchā, yathā pacchā tathā pure.","thag6.4:6.1":"“Pañcaṅgikena turiyena, na ratī hoti tādisī;","thag6.4:6.3":"Yathā ekaggacittassa, sammā dhammaṃ vipassato”ti.","thag6.4:6.5":"… Kullo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
